  {
    
    "name": "Section 2",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-632523952991896149 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=632523952941433429&sectionId=632523952991896149)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJm6-9N8lO_text","label":"ggJm6-9N8lO_text","default":"Preserve the Stories Behind the People You Love"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLnGGDLgV5_text","label":"ggLnGGDLgV5_text","default":"<p>Some of the most meaningful family stories involve people who have been part of your life for years.</p><p>A photograph with grandparents can preserve a special family connection.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A childhood picture can remind parents of how quickly their children have grown. A group photo can capture a moment when everyone was together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Turning these photographs into keepsakes gives those memories a visible place in your home and makes it easier to keep sharing their stories with future generations.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Not every meaningful story comes from a major celebration. Sometimes the best memories are found in ordinary moments.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A family eating together, children playing in the backyard, a funny moment with a pet, or everyone laughing during a vacation can become a favorite story years later.</p><p>These everyday photographs can make wonderful Memobrick designs because they capture the real personality of your family.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPIgGYMHFw_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggPIgGYMHFw_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/081e58f1-f3c5-42a2-bf2f-97912865339e_ffa2dee4-39f5-487a-9085-537a4c7513c8.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCHNzFX81s_text","label":"ggCHNzFX81s_text","default":"Create Something the Whole Family Can Enjoy"},{"type":"html","id":"ggs5cpA7vE3_text","label":"ggs5cpA7vE3_text","default":"<p>A personalized Memobrick does not have to be something one person builds alone. It can become a family activity.</p><p>Parents can build with their children. Grandparents can work alongside their grandchildren. Siblings can recreate a favorite family photograph together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>As everyone places the pieces, the photograph slowly becomes recognizable. Along the way, conversations about the memory behind the picture can turn the building experience into another family story worth remembering.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwLw9iC0af_text","label":"ggwLw9iC0af_text","default":"Choosing a Photo With a Story Behind It"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLoDjoAwJd_text","label":"ggLoDjoAwJd_text","default":"<p>The best photo does not necessarily have to be the most professionally taken picture. Look for an image that immediately brings back a memory.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You could choose:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• A favorite childhood photograph</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• A family vacation</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• A wedding or anniversary</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• A holiday gathering</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• A funny family moment</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• A special milestone</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• A photograph with a loved one</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For the best results, choose a clear photo with good lighting and recognizable subjects. Smaller Memobrick sizes work especially well with close up photos and fewer subjects, while larger sizes allow more room for group photos and additional details.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWX5kCdW0i_text","label":"ggWX5kCdW0i_text","default":"<p>Our favorite family stories are not always written down. Sometimes they live in the photographs we keep, the memories we share, and the moments we continue talking about years later.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Memobrick gives those stories a physical place in your home. By turning a meaningful photograph into a personalized brick mosaic, you can build, display, and revisit the memories that make your family unique.</p><p>Because some family stories are too special to leave hidden in a camera roll. <strong>They deserve to be seen.</strong></p>"}],
    "blocks": [{"type": "@app"}],
    "locales": {}
  }
{% endschema %}